  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4104.46 Solid",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4104.46 “Solid” means a substance or mixture of substances that, whether whole or subdivided into particles, such as those comprising a powder, is not capable of visually detectable flow using the method in ASTM D-4359-90(2000)e1. The term does not include liquids or gels.\n\nSource. #10527, eff 2-26-14; ss by #13969, eff 5-21-24 (formerly Env-A 4104.47)",
